{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"Yin hashes primitive profiles during startup, before any explicit store operation. I’ll use an in-process BLAKE3 implementation for that core path and keep SHA-256 as the call-time C4 refusal. That preserves Yin’s content addresses and gives the gate a real store operation to test."}}
