pture? joltffi-foreign-capture-procedure joltffi-foreign-procedure)\n                         args ret name variadic)))))\n    (lambda args\n      (joltffi-public-error (lambda () (apply fp args))))))\n\n(define (joltffi-str-arg what x)\n  (if (jolt-nil? x)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
