nner-lines composition) opts))\n     #?(:cljd false :jolt true :default false)\n     (into [shell/host-text\n            ;; J5: the native parser is disclosed; with no usable library\n            ;; Python is left out of the catalog and the reason is printed\n            #?(:jolt (if (python.antlr.parser/available?)\n                       (str \"python: the native C++ ANTLR4 parser\"\n                            \" (native/jolt-parser), in process; no process\"\n                            \" crash isolation\")\n                       \"python: unavailable-parser (the native parser library is missing or incompatible; bb build:jolt-native)\")\n               :default nil)]))))\n\n\n(defn- exit-with!\n44:(defn refused?\n5460b037 2026-11-20T05:37:22+07:00 docs(collab): the f-strings completion re-dispatched to glm-5.3 — deepseek 402'd (balance), the zcode lane quota-died; the 795-insertion state is the invariant across attempts\n56d17563 2026-11-20T05:13:56+07:00 fix(bin): analyze-deps high-degree predicate counts combined in+out degree >= 6 — matching docs/agents/malleability.md's documented rule; the old in>=5 OR out>=5 form selected a different population than the label claimed\n630ddbf7 2026-11-20T05:09:37+07:00 docs(orchestrator-log): the DRY seat log tail — batch-2 landing, architect sign-off, graph check verdict, jupiter cleanup\n[1795128451s] load dao.stream.cbor.boring\n[1795128457s] ready dao.stream.cbor.boring\n[1795128457s] ready dao.stream.cbor\n[1795128457s] load dao.stream.remote-channel\n[1795128457s] load dao.stream.remote\n[1795128458s] load dao.stream.middleware\n[1795128461s] ready dao.stream.middleware\n[1795128471s] ready dao.stream.remote\n[1795128471s] load dao.stream.remote-route\n[1795128471s] load dao.lease\nThu Nov 19 22:47:54 UTC 2026\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
